        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p>Attend this first 2026 <a href=\"https://www.placedesarts.com/en/entretiens-arts-et-societes\">Entretiens arts et société</a>, hosted by Rose-Aimée Automne T. Morin, who will open the dialogue with her guests on the questions everyone is asking.</p>"
      }
