        "@value": "<p>In this 60-minute Happy Symphonic Hour, experience the extraordinary talent of Jason Xu, winner of the 2024 OSM Competition, as he brings out the full technical richness of the saxophone in Frank Martin’s <i>Ballade</i>.</p>"
      }
    ],
