    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p>A passionate artist, Claude Dubois has always sung our stories, our loves, and our joys. With <i>Dubois Biographie symphonique</i>, GSI Musique offers a creation in the artist’s image—free and vibrant—where each note becomes a memory and paints the portrait of an artist who continues to move and inspire. </p>"
      }
    ],
