    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Immerse yourself in the spellbinding world of the Moires legend ! Come and discover these three witches, incarnations of the sisters of destiny, dancing with oversized braids, in a captivating show for all ages. After the show, join them for a friendly get-together with parents, children and families.   Moïra by Morgane Le Tiec  Three female witches, embodying the sisters of destiny, unleash their energy in a spellbinding visual and aural universe. We watch as the performers skilfully manipulate their long braids to play with fate. This piece will captivate young and old alike. “Moïra is the portion of life, happiness, misfortune and glory assigned to each mortal by fate, and which the gods themselves cannot change."
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/headline": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Family show with Cie Sursaut | Cinquième Salle"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/inLanguage": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "en-ca"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Family show with Cie Sursaut | Cinquième Salle"
      }
    ]
  },
