    "http://schema.org/copyrightYear": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "2024"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Jean-Marc Parent’s stories are surprising, moving, intelligent, funny … and we never get tired of hearing them.  With his authentic and relatable style of humour, he invites audiences to find something of themselves in his endless anecdotes. He’s a talented storyteller who tells jokes as much as he’s a talented comedian who tells stories. That’s why so many people love him and have been following him since his early days.    As part of its 25 th anniversary, ComediHa! is once again teaming up with celebrated comedian Jean-Marc Parent to bring Quebec crowds privileged access to his latest adventures. Fans will have two chances to catch the show and witness the comedian tackling topics from the weather and accents to his recent trip to Europe. With a DJ on hand to help set the mood, join Jean-Marc as shares his stories and secrets and, as always, makes us laugh.  "
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/headline": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Jean-Marc Parent - L'Évènement JMP | Salle Wilfrid-Pelletier"
      }
    ],
