      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "The original Jersey Boy himself, Frankie Valli is a true American legend. His incredible career with the Four Seasons , as well as his solo success, has spawned countless hit singles with unforgettable tunes like Sherry, Walk Like A Man, Big Girls Don’t Cry, Can’t Take My Eyes Off You, Let’s Hang…"
