    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The original Jersey Boy himself, Frankie Valli is a true American legend. His incredible career with the Four Seasons , as well as his solo success, has spawned countless hit singles with unforgettable tunes like Sherry, Walk Like A Man, Big Girls Don’t Cry, Can’t Take My Eyes Off You, Let’s Hang On, My Eyes Adored You, and of course, Grease .   Valli’s long-lasting career has led to the overwhelming success of the Broadway musical Jersey Boys , which chronicles Frankie Valli & the Four Seasons’ incredible career.   Frankie Valli and the Four Seasons are on the road again and their return to Montreal is long overdue!"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/headline": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Frankie Valli and the Four Seasons | Salle Wilfrid-Pelletier"
      }
    ],
