        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Place des Arts is Canada's largest arts and cultural complex. Located in downtown Montreal, Quebec, Place des Arts has six performance halls, including the Salle Wilfrid-Pelletier, the country's largest 3,000-seat multi-purpose hall, the Maison symphonique de Montreal and the Theatre Maisonneuve."
