        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Concluding the 2020-2021 season, the concert offered by the Atelier lyrique de l’Opéra de Montréal promises to be an unforgettable event. It will feature the most beautiful arias and opera ensembles, performed by the graduating class. Following an unprecedented year, during which the…"
