        "@value": "2021"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Concluding the 2020-2021 season, the concert offered by the Atelier lyrique de l’Opéra de Montréal promises to be an unforgettable event. It will feature the most beautiful arias and opera ensembles, performed by the graduating class. Following an unprecedented year, during which the artists-in-residence have shown great determination and resilience, this concert marks the end of a rather unusual season and the return of brighter days. Join us in celebrating this magical moment!"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/headline": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "End-Of-Season Concert – Atelier lyrique | Théâtre Maisonneuve"
      }
    ],
