        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p>A Family Christmas with the Wainwright/McGarrigle. Benefit concert for the Kate McGarrigle Fund and Canadian Cystinosis Research Foundation, with special guests: Lou-Adriane Cassidy, Thierry Larose, Ariane Roy, Anna McGarrigle, Safia Nolin, The Barr Brothers, Amy Millan, La Force! </p>"
