    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p>Three of Quebec's most beautiful voices, Joe Bocan, Marie Carmen, and Marie Denise Pelletier, will once again reunite on stage with <i>Pour une autre histoire d'un soir</i>, a revamped version of the show that earned them the Félix for Spectacle de l'année Variétés/Réinterprétations in 2022 and attracted more than 50,000 spectators.  </p>"
      }
    ],
