      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p>Amine Hachem is a leading tenor in opera, musical theatre, and concert stages around the world. Known for his captivating performances by iHeart Radio, he's recognized for pushing the boundaries of operatic music by integrating it with unconventional sounds from around the globe.</p>"
      }
