    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p>In the vibrant heart of Montréal, the soul of Algeria drifts in like a warm desert breeze. For one luminous evening, Chaâbi music—rooted in both Algiers and Kabylia—merges into a poetic soundscape that transports audiences to a bygone era, alive and resonant as ever. </p>"
      }
    ],
